  <h2 id="fresher">The fresher reality, by background</h2>

  <p>
    Fresher seats exist, but a fresher rarely lands as a module consultant on day one. Practitioner threads on SAP Community describe getting a job that uses SAP first and learning the configuration side on the side. The route depends on what you already know.
